{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Great-grandfather left behind an empty building, perfect for running a hotel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person perspective, simulating the experience of operating a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advertising</strong><br>Spend money to distribute ads, attracting guests of different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Management</strong><br>Configure various room types to meet guest needs. Clean rooms, remove trash, scrub stains, and arrange furnishings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost &amp; Found</strong><br>Guests may leave behind valuable items. Handling these items appropriately can bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security Management</strong><br>The guest crowd is diverse and may include shady characters. Report suspicious clues to the police.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotel Star Rating</strong><br>Unlock higher floors, open more room types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Decoration</strong><br>Unlock decorative items to furnish rooms, attracting higher-level guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotel Relocation</strong><br>Hire a moving company to relocate the building to a higher-value area, increasing overall room rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire staff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate hotel management.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729900?t=1769914949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729900/d510a8232de18ca2dd899b28a6cb18988c0c0742/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769914949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729900/840cf991412278c6fde7a89ab84caf4d6382e5f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769914949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729900/840cf991412278c6fde7a89ab84caf4d6382e5f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769914949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4079740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Great-grandfather left behind an empty building, perfect for running a hotel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person perspective, simulating the experience of operating a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advertising</strong><br>Spend money to distribute ads, attracting guests of different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Management</strong><br>Configure various room types to meet guest needs. Clean rooms, remove trash, scrub stains, and arrange furnishings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost &amp; Found</strong><br>Guests may leave behind valuable items. Handling these items appropriately can bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security Management</strong><br>The guest crowd is diverse and may include shady characters. Report suspicious clues to the police.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotel Star Rating</strong><br>Unlock higher floors, open more room types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Decoration</strong><br>Unlock decorative items to furnish rooms, attracting higher-level guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotel Relocation</strong><br>Hire a moving company to relocate the building to a higher-value area, increasing overall room rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire staff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate hotel management.  </p>","developers":[" MakeThings"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729900/85c706064d8337ff4864b6e0b2a2302da91f96e8/header.jpg?t=1769914949","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729900/2089657762/e1a04b80d0c08d923a55bf3ff6dad8d24da48676/1760373622/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760374305","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729900/2089657762/e1a04b80d0c08d923a55bf3ff6dad8d24da48676/1760373622/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760374305","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729900/2089657762/e1a04b80d0c08d923a55bf3ff6dad8d24da48676/1760373622/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760374305","id":257217187,"name":"game play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217187/91124d808f5b000ce47a14acf23a7ed112d54417/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760374305"}],"name":"Hotel Keeper ","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro